# Publish ONLY the docs/ folder as a GitHub Pages site.
# Everything else in this directory is local working material and must stay unpublished.

# 1. Exclude every top-level entry by default.
/*

# 2. Re-include only what belongs in the public repository.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/docs/

# 3. Belt and braces: never track local working material,
#    even if a rule above is ever relaxed.
/.claude/
/CLAUDE.md
